.002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Skubitz</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pambuccian</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Argenta</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Skubitz</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differential gene expression identifies subgroups of ovarian carcinoma</article-title><source>Transl Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>148</volume><fpage>223</fpage><lpage>248</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17145569</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.trsl.2006.06.001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tos</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Classification of pleomorphic sarcomas: where are we now?</article-title><source>Histopathology</source><year>2006</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>51</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16359537</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2559.2005.02289.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fletcher</surname><given-names>CDM</given-names></name><name><surname>Uni</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name></person-group><source>World Health Organization Classification of Tumors Pathology and Genetics fo Tumors of Soft Tissue and Bone</source><year>2002</year><publisher-name>Lyon: IARC Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Costa</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wesley</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Glatstein</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenberg</surname><given-names>SA</